{{ModBox}}'''{{BASEPAGENAME}}''' is a [[Companion]] [[mod]] that creates [[Summons|a short-lived duplicate]] of the companion after '''100''' {{Stat|Energy}} is spent, up to '''3''' clones. Enemies killed by these clones have a chance at dropping an [[File:IconEnergy.gif]][[Energy Orb]].

